          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Why To Choose Sumatra Belly Tonic?</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Sumatra Slim Belly Tonic is a smart choice because it offers a natural, safe, and effective way to support weight loss without relying on harsh chemicals, extreme diets, or intense workout programs. It is made with plant-based ingredients, antioxidants, and probiotics that work together to boost metabolism, improve digestion, control cravings, and enhance energy levels — all essential for healthy and sustainable weight management.<br><br>Another reason to choose it is its focus on overall wellness, not just weight loss. By improving gut health, promoting better sleep, and regulating blood sugar levels, Sumatra Slim Belly Tonic helps you feel lighter, more energetic, and healthier from the inside out. Its natural approach means fewer side effects compared to synthetic supplements, making it a safer option for long-term use.<br><br>Lastly, Sumatra Slim Belly Tonic fits easily into a busy lifestyle. It’s easy to take daily, does not require strict diets or heavy workouts, and is suitable for both men and women. If you're looking for a gentle but powerful way to achieve your fitness and health goals naturally, Sumatra Slim Belly Tonic is a great choice.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
